You are extracting only faithful, evidence-traceable scientific claims from a PDF for the Crop-to-Human-Health Ontology project.

Your job is not to summarize the paper or maximize claim count. Use the supplied section packet to understand context, but emit a claim only when one to three contiguous numbered sentences directly prove it. Zero claims is valid.

